{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"## Verification evidence (for the [non-codebase] acceptance criteria)\n\nThese three criteria are run-results / process evidence that inherently live outside the repository snapshot; documenting the concrete artifacts here per the completion-verifier's evidence path.\n\n### RED→GREEN + mutation teeth (both instances)\n\nTests were authored held-out from the fixer and confirmed RED against the UNFIXED `infra/scripts/autodeploy.sh` before the two manifest additions were applied.\n\n- Instance 1 — `tests/scripts/test_autodeploy_signals_gerrit_config.py`\n  - `test_autodeploy_signals_config_manual` parametrized over `_CONFIG_MANUAL_SOURCES = [(\"infra/compose/gerrit.config\",\"gerrit.config\"), (\"infra/gerrit/materialize-deploy-key.sh\", None)]`.\n  - RED before fix: the `materialize-deploy-key.sh` param produced NO `AUTODEPLOY_ERROR reason=config_manual` signal (path absent from `CONFIG_PATHS`); the `gerrit.config` param passed.\n  - GREEN after adding `infra/gerrit/materialize-deploy-key.sh` to `CONFIG_PATHS`: deploy-key-only change emits `AUTODEPLOY_ERROR reason=config_manual` + \"MANUAL operator apply\".\n  - Mutation teeth: emptying the `CONFIG_PATHS` entry → back to RED; restoring → GREEN.\n\n- Instance 2 — `tests/scripts/test_autodeploy_mcp_bluegreen.py`\n  - `test_entrypoint_source_change_rebuilds_the_mcp_image` drives the real `autodeploy.sh` under a git shim where ONLY `infra/scripts/mcp-entrypoint.sh` changed.\n  - RED before fix: no mcp deploy, 0 `docker compose build mcp` (path absent from `MCP_PATHS`).\n  - GREEN after adding `infra/scripts/mcp-entrypoint.sh` to `MCP_PATHS`: existing blue-green mcp deploy path fires — `docker compose build mcp` invoked + nginx upstream flipped.\n  - Mutation teeth: emptying the `MCP_PATHS` entry → back to RED; restoring → GREEN.\n\n### `make lint` (incl. shellcheck)\n\n`make lint` PASSED locally in the worktree (ruff check + format-check + shellcheck over `infra/scripts/autodeploy.sh`). Independently re-run by CI: the `build-and-test / lint + type-check` job of GitHub Actions run 33333127540 succeeded, contributing to `Verified +1` on Gerrit change 2444.\n\n### Full `tests/scripts` suite\n\nFull local run: **1313 passed, 3 skipped**. Independently re-run by CI: the `pytest` matrix jobs (ubuntu py3.11/3.12/3.13, macos py3.13) of run 33333127540 all succeeded, contributing to `Verified +1` on change 2444.\n\n### Landing\n\nGerrit change 2444 (https://rebar.solutions.navateam.com/c/rebar/+/2444) — `LLM-Review +1` AND `Verified +1`, 0 unresolved comments — **MERGED** to `main`. Commit `27ac63f7c4392ae88203fff9ee38d1bdca9e0307` carries `rebar-ticket: 408c-9c78-c523-4d1c` and mentions both ids (408c + 5d4c) in the body."},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1788123789152428700,"uuid":"6430b84f-4457-46a5-ade9-495c54e0e6f8"}